msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"    ## Generative UI (Artifacts) Instructions\n"
"    When the user asks for a UI, dashboard, interactive tool, or visualization:\n"
"    1. Write a complete, self-contained HTML page inside a single ```html code block.\n"
"    2. Use Tailwind CSS (via CDN: <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) for styling and Lucide Icons or FontAwesome for icons.\n"
"    3. Include interactive JavaScript (e.g., Chart.js for charts, or simple state management).\n"
"    4. Do not split the code into multiple blocks; keep it in one unified ```html block.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
" ## Petunjuk UI Generatif (Artefak)\n"
" Saat pengguna meminta UI, dasbor, alat interaktif, atau visualisasi:\n"
" 1. Tulis halaman HTML lengkap dan mandiri di dalam satu ```blok kode HTML.\n"
" 2. Gunakan Tailwind CSS (melalui CDN: <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) untuk penataan gaya dan Ikon Lucide atau FontAwesome untuk ikon.\n"
" 3. Sertakan JavaScript interaktif (misalnya, Chart.js untuk bagan, atau manajemen status sederhana).\n"
" 4. Jangan membagi kode menjadi beberapa blok; simpan dalam satu blok ```html terpadu.\n"
"    "

